{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_21939","headline":"杂兴三首 二 · 白居易","name":"杂兴三首 二","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"越国政初荒，越天旱不已。\n风日燥水田，水涸尘飞起。\n国中新下令，官渠禁流水。\n流水不入田，壅入王宫里。\n余波养鱼鸟，倒影浮楼雉。\n澹灩九折池，萦回十余里。\n四月芰荷发，越王日游嬉。\n左右好风来，香动芙蓉蘂。\n但爱芙蓉香，又种芙蓉子。\n不念阊门外，千里稻苗死。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"白居易","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_21939.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_21939","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}